{"id":"nastol_ko","lemma":"настолько","pos":"conj","rank":425,"glosses":["as"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a6/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BA%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BA%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Это было настолько очевидно?","en":"Was it that obvious?","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,{"g":"apparently, obviously"}]},{"text":"Это действительно настолько важно?","en":"Is it really that important?","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"really"},null,{"g":"importantly"}]},{"text":"Неужели я выгляжу настолько глупо?","en":"Do I look that stupid?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/655365","words":[{"g":"really?"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to look","l":"выглядеть"},null,{"g":"foolishly, stupidly"}]},{"text":"Всё не может быть настолько плохо.","en":"Things can't be all that bad.","words":[{"g":"everything, all"},{"g":"not"},null,null,null,{"g":"bad, badly"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"maybe"]]},{"text":"Я старый, но не настолько.","en":"I'm old, but I'm not that old.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"old"},{"g":"but"},{"g":"not"},null]}]}